n Achilli is supposed to be about playing Neonate Anarchs, they release a supplement all about playing Elders and higher Generation vampires in general.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T02:56:30-07:00","id":1522045,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522042#post1522042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Me and my friends were talking about how one of the funniest outcomes for WOD5E would be that in trying to find new topics to write about in supplements, they just slowly start to write back in all the lore and worldbuilding they had ignored and/or written out of the fifth edition before. Like for V5, the game that according to Justin Achilli is supposed to be about playing Neonate Anarchs, they release a supplement all about playing Elders and higher Generation vampires in general.</div> </div> </div> </div>I had extremely high hopes for SABBAT and SECOND INQUISITION.<br /> <br /> Justin Achilli as a writer really had me reved up.<br /> <br /> Sadly, those books killed my love of V5.<br /> <br /> *hugs OPP supplements*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T11:07:24-07:00","id":1522059,"title":"","content":"Hmmmm, machine for pigs was solid 7 out of 10 game that seems the norm for then. Its surprising they've sacked off the thin blood idea and gone with eldar considering v5 in general, I wonder what triggured that? Playing an ancient mega vampire is an untapped well.<br /> <br /> This leans into the game being 'ok' which would be fine<br /> <br /> certainly not what i anticipated but I watch with interest.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26986,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","user":"Ragged Robin","date":". 09-04-2023, 02:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T11:14:36-07:00","id":1522061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522042#post1522042\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Me and my friends were talking about how one of the funniest outcomes for WOD5E would be that in trying to find new topics to write about in supplements, they just slowly start to write back in all the lore and worldbuilding they had ignored and/or written out of the fifth edition before. Like for V5, the game that according to Justin Achilli is supposed to be about playing Neonate Anarchs, they release a supplement all about playing Elders and higher Generation vampires in general.</div> </div> </div> </div>Theirs been a disconnect between the books and the game for a while. Bloodhunt for example makes a mockery of v5s attitude to action orientated games.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T12:09:35-07:00","id":1522063,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522061#post1522061\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Theirs been a disconnect between the books and the game for a while. Bloodhunt for example makes a mockery of v5s attitude to action orientated games.</div> </div> </div> </div>Similarly, COTERIES OF NEW YORK and its sequel is pretty heavy on the continuity/NPCs and all the better for it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T12:17:17-07:00","id":1522064,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1521978#post1521978\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On a more positive note, having the player character an Elder is pretty different and interesting and I'm curious about what sort of direction the story could go in.</div> </div> </div> </div>Or maybe an excuse to introduce a character who needs to learn and thus introduce the concepts of V5 since he was in a coma and at the same time not need to give him a growth, since he is not a newbie, just an old man getting the rust off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-04T12:51:56-07:00","id":1522067,"title":"","content":"i'm hoping that TCR has been told to play VtM: Redemption... since there's already been a VtM videogame about a fairly powerful (in only because cRPG level up speed) vampire that wakes up in modern times after a prolonged torpor. There's a decent amount to look at (and look at reviews/etc.) when considered that premise.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-05T01:00:33-07:00","id":1522086,"title":"","content":"From the trailer, the sort of game I envision is this:<ul><li>80% of the time you're playing a walking-simulator - lots of environmental storytelling, little interaction, some simple puzzles</li> <li>By picking a Clan you can change the appearance of your character but there's only one male VA and one female VA who deliver the same lines for 99% of the time no matter what you pick (because the story is pretty linear and always plays out the same)</li> <li>Then the other 20% are combat-encounters where in a limited space you're gonna use your powers (and depending on what Clan you picked you have different ones) but in terms of gameplay it's mostly just a bunch of button-mashing and (depending on the Clan) various kinds of visual effects happen on the screen</li> <li>And in terms of length, a playthrough takes 4 to 5 hours and there's little replay-value as the big focus is on the story and that one always plays out the same no matter what Clan you pick</li> <li>Maybe it has one of those endings where right at the end you get presented with 2 or 3 choices and then you get different endings depending on what choice you make</li> </ul>I think another big thing would be if it ends up being this sort of mid-tier modest game but still costs 70 bucks (or even more if you get the various limited editions). But that's sort of my best guess for what this game could end up being like.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-05T01:44:16-07:00","id":1522087,"title":"","content":"I should point out that THE CHINESE ROOM has literally no employees who worked on Amnesia or the other walking simulator.<br /> <br /> I am willing to bet cash money it is just a graphics updated BLOODLINES.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-05T01:56:53-07:00","id":1522088,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522087#post1522087\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I should point out that THE CHINESE ROOM has literally no employees who worked on Amnesia or the other walking simulator.<br /> <br /> I am willing to bet cash money it is just a graphics updated BLOODLINES.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well yeah and if it were a true-to-form walking-simulator, there would be no combat at all. It's more about saving costs and development-time. That's why I think it will be like that in this instance. This won't be some ambitious open-world-game or allow the sort of sandbox-flexibility of a game like Dishonored or Hitman.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-05T02:10:59-07:00","id":1522089,"title":"","content":"I'm not sure I'm that pessimistic, but I don't really know TCR's work well enough to say. I've seen small studios step up to big games successfully.<br /> <br /> My red flags are:<br /> <br /> 1) Tencent (via Sumo) is always a small red flag, simply because they are not in the industry to make art, or promote art. They'll gladly sacrifice anything remotely aesthetically good about the game to squeeze in some sort of monetization if they' can. Tencent is notorious for either copying other companies, or buying those it can't successfully imitate, because the company doesn't value creativity or innovation. Plus Tencent has used it's ever growing portfolio to push programs with shitty digital security, and to pressure for Chinese state censorship. A 10% share in TCR isn't enough to control it outright, but it's enough money that if they want something and are willing to take their money away if they don't get it, it could be a problem (though Paradox is big enough to shore that up if they wanted to).<br /> <br /> 2) Like most video game fans, I'm exceedingly skeptical of no real game play demos. It's easy to make a pretty video that looks like game play, but it's just a pre-render that looks far better than the final product ever will. If this is supposed to come out next year, they are quickly running out of time to demonstrate that they have an actual game to play, instead of some fancy visuals.<br /> <br /> 3) The whole style of faux-interview always rubs me the wrong way. They're not being asked real questions, they're reading ad copy from a script. It's not authentic, and we all know it. I'm not saying anyone in those ads doesn't believe it, but it's not a great way to sell because it just highlights how much they're saying the things they think we want to hear instead of having anything to say about the things we should hear.<br /> <br /> Basically, they've told us a bunch of things, but shown us nothing, and TCR doesn't have a reputation to trade on to put that aside.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-05T02:38:06-07:00","id":1522090,"title":"","content":"Also to indicate what the other game is like that Chinese Room also have been working on at the same time as Bloodlines 2 (it's also slated to be released next year), here's the blurb for Still Wakes The Deep:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> STILL WAKES THE DEEP is a return to the first-person narrative horror genre for The Chinese Room, creator of critically acclaimed games such as Amnesia: A Machine for Pigs, Everybody\u2019s Gone to the Rapture, and Dear Esther.<br /> <br /> You are an off-shore oil rig worker, fighting for your life through a vicious storm, perilous surroundings, and the dark, freezing North Sea waters. All lines of communication have been severed. All exits are gone. All that remains is to face the unknowable horror that\u2019s come aboard.\u200b<br /> <br /> Search for your crew and help them survive if you can. Run, climb, and swim through the flooding corridors and storm-lashed outer decks. Face a terrifying, unrelenting foe. And pray that, one day, you get to see your family again.<br /> <br /> The Chinese Room \u2013 with its reputation for world-class world-building, audio, writing, and acting \u2013 delivers a symphony of action, trepidation, tender emotions, and awe.\u200b </div> </div> </div>So it's a horror-game in the style of Layers Of Fear or Outlast (that are sort-of the successors to the original Amnesia as they developed the formula of this type of game a bit more).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T10:25:36-07:00","id":1522224,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.themarysue.com/is-vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-update-really-good-news/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://www.themarysue.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/09/Vampire-the-Masquerade-Bloodlines-2-new-trailer-copy.jpg\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.themarysue.com/is-vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-update-really-good-news/\" target=\"_blank\"> This Long-Awaited Game Sequel Finally Has an Update&mdash;But Is It Good News? </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.themarysue.com/is-vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-update-really-good-news/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.themarysue.com/is-vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-update-really-good-news/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> It's alive!!! Thanks to The Chinese Room! </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Mary Sue had an interesting article on all of the revelations.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T12:50:00-07:00","id":1522229,"title":"","content":"It's a nice little article for people that haven't been paying close attention to this, but I think for people in this thread, it's not really adding much: Hype matters a lot to video games. There's good reasons for fans to start feeling some hype, but there's also good reasons for fans to have their guard up and not be hyped at this point.<br /> <br /> If you compare this article to her piece on Dragon Age: Dreawolf's news earlier this year, you can see a pretty significant difference in making the case for her answer to &quot;Is It Good News?&quot; being yes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-07T14:04:58-07:00","id":1522232,"title":"","content":"The article goes for a more optimistic take... without really making a case for that. The conclusion is based mostly on vibes. And that Disco Elysium comparison is a bit of a reach. With a scope that broad, you could also say something as pessimistic and speculative &quot;Remember when Bioware took all the goodwill of having a character with a defined role but some roleplaying-freedoms during the game in Shephard during the Mass Effect trilogy (with Mass Effect 3 already causing some controversy)...? And then they all squandered that with the disastrous follow-up Mass Effect: Andromeda? Will Bloodlines 2 be the &quot;Andromeda&quot; to the &quot;Mass Effect&quot; of Bloodlines 1...?&quot;.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think they messed up massively during the early half of Bloodlines 2\u2032s development, but going dark until they had a release window was a shrewd decision, and I think The Chinese Room will ultimately prove to be a smart decision, as well. Only time will tell, sure, but I like what I\u2019ve heard and seen thus far, and I\u2019m already getting a little excited about the finished product. Plus, they\u2019re being very open about their future plans: On their website, they promise to show us all playable clans up to the end of 2023, then show us gameplay beginning in 2024. </div> </div> </div>That doesn't sound convincing at all... There's so much fakery in videogames-advertising these days and considering how little we know... we have to wait till early 2024 for gameplay?! Hopefully, they're not scummy enough to activate pre-orders before that but I wouldn't be surprised if you can already pre-order your 100 bucks Limited Edition before January 2024. If you compare this to the PR-campaign of Path of Exile 2, there's very little to get excited about for Bloodlines 2.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-08T05:19:58-07:00","id":1522264,"title":"","content":"The big questions after Baldur\u2019s Gate 3 for a lot of gamers are going to be; how complete will the game be at launch? How many paid DLC and microtransactions will be required for the complete experience.<br /> <br /> If it follows in BG3\u2019s footsteps (i.e. complete game with no extra paid content required) then BL2 could earn a lot of good will (and sales) by tapping into the anti-corpo/anti-skinner box zeitgeist.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1328-chris24601","name":"Chris24601","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"520"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-08T07:40:45-07:00","id":1522265,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522232#post1522232\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The article goes for a more optimistic take... without really making a case for that. The conclusion is based mostly on vibes. And that Disco Elysium comparison is a bit of a reach. With a scope that broad, you could also say something as pessimistic and speculative &quot;Remember when Bioware took all the goodwill of having a character with a defined role but some roleplaying-freedoms during the game in Shephard during the Mass Effect trilogy (with Mass Effect 3 already causing some controversy)...? And then they all squandered that with the disastrous follow-up Mass Effect: Andromeda? Will Bloodlines 2 be the &quot;Andromeda&quot; to the &quot;Mass Effect&quot; of Bloodlines 1...?&quot;.<br /> <br /> That doesn't sound convincing at all... There's so much fakery in videogames-advertising these days and considering how little we know... we have to wait till early 2024 for gameplay?! Hopefully, they're not scummy enough to activate pre-orders before that but I wouldn't be surprised if you can already pre-order your 100 bucks Limited Edition before January 2024. If you compare this to the PR-campaign of Path of Exile 2, there's very little to get excited about for Bloodlines 2.</div> </div> </div> </div>Can you explain what the proper course of action is? They seem to have gone dark to make sure that they had the game almost done before announcing everything. Which seems unusually responsible for a game company.<br /> <br /> Likewise, they refunded the orders that no longer applied.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-08T08:41:59-07:00","id":1522266,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522265#post1522265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can you explain what the proper course of action is?</div> </div> </div> </div>Sure.<ul><li>Transparency: The switch to Chinese Room should've been announced the moment it happened. Instead of leaving people in the dark, just state that another studio is working on it now. The situation with Hardsuit Labs was bad, of course, and deciding to switch doesn't look good. But to keep hype for the game alive, the switch should've been announced to at least make clear that things are happening - instead of the limbo the public has been left in for years. Nobody thinks big games are made overnight but the initial announcement of Bloodlines 2 had hype and to keep it alive, they should've made the public aware that the game is being worked on, that it <i>will </i>see the light of day as soon as they had switched to Chinese Room.</li> <li>Also, people kept on pestering Outstar on the WOD-news-show on Twitch about Bloodlines 2 news (it pretty much came up every time I watched her show). And the fact that there had been news (the switch to Chinese Room) but instead, Paradox's PR-strategy had been to tell her to say nothing just... feels bad. People were indeed still invested and instead, Paradox chose to leave them in the dark.</li> <li>The moment the game reaches the state in development where it's presentable and finished (or at least close to finished), in order to counter all the doubts and issues of the past, the main-thing should've been gameplay. Of course, game-companies have even lied about supposed &quot;game-play footage&quot; in the past but assuming it's legit, that stuff works better than these trailers that only give you a tiny glimpse of what the game is like.</li> <li>Also, this tiny-portions-approach seems to me more frustrating than a way to build up hype. We got the announcement of the announcement a couple of months ago, now we got the announcement of the development-studio and at the start of next year we're gonna get gameplay-footage. Why does this process have to be drawn out over half a year? The game is gonna come out in a year anyway (if everything goes as planned). How many people who have now become aware of Bloodlines 2 again will remember to look for the Clan-stuff at the end of the year and the gameplay-stuff at the start of next year? You already had the announcement of an announcement but then said announcement was used to tell people that the details will be announced at yet another preview later on.</li> <li>Instead, the formula should be &quot;Gameplay, gameplay and MORE gameplay.&quot;. Show off what's cool about the game and make people interested in playing it. Even if it's a linear story with tiny variations like I fear, even then the gameplay-preview is about getting people invested in the story, so that they want to play the game and find out what happens.</li> </ul>The game is supposed to come out in a year. This close to launch there's really no need to hide stuff anymore and tease things. Assuming development isn't massively behind schedule, this announcement should've featured someone playing the actual game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-08T21:14:15-07:00","id":1522291,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522265#post1522265\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Can you explain what the proper course of action is? They seem to have gone dark to make sure that they had the game almost done before announcing everything. Which seems unusually responsible for a game company.<br /> <br /> Likewise, they refunded the orders that no longer applied.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> a terrible course of action knowing the current context of video games publishing.<br /> <br /> By doing their announcements so close to the desired release, they ensured that when it happen, the change of studios and all the linked bullshit will be fresh on players' minds, and gave us months if not years of apathy imagining the project was eother in absolute disarray or simply dead. While announcing that the project was well in other hands as soon as the contract was signed would have garanteed a more optimistic, if cautious view.<br /> <br /> Transparency is a virtue in video game devellopement. Especially in the current context.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Another thing that make me cautious is the form of the announcement. We had a few fragment of out of context gameplay and a false interview style presentation of the project.<br /> <br /> If the game is really this close to release, then the dev must have enough materials to actually show off their gameplay. This is another PR error. After waiting so long to announce the status of the project , what was provided is very dry.<br /> <br /> The Chinese Room and Paradox better use the months up to release to flood us with infos and gameplay, otherwise they risk a bad surprise at release and afterward","signature":"","edited":{"userid":24043,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","user":"Nyremne","date":". 09-09-2023, 12:30 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-09T19:32:39-07:00","id":1522324,"title":"","content":"Basically, I give them a lot of props. They made the correct choice of having the game only shown again when they were almost done and close to finishing. The jankiness gone and so on means that it will be the best possible impression for people.<br /> <br /> A lot of the complaints say, &quot;We should have gameplay!&quot;<br /> <br /> Vs.<br /> <br /> &quot;We should have had footage the entire way!&quot;<br /> <br /> Which seem contradictory.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-09T21:16:54-07:00","id":1522326,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522324#post1522324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> A lot of the complaints say, &quot;We should have gameplay!&quot;<br /> <br /> Vs.<br /> <br /> &quot;We should have had footage the entire way!&quot;<br /> <br /> Which seem contradictory.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well it's because that's not really the complains.<br /> <br /> Yes, we should have gameplay for a game less than a year before release.<br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200b\u200bbut people here are not complaining that we should have had footage the entire way. But that we should have had *news*, the entire way.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24043-nyremne","name":"Nyremne","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"414"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T13:21:49-07:00","id":1522355,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522324#post1522324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Basically, I give them a lot of props. They made the correct choice of having the game only shown again when they were almost done and close to finishing. The jankiness gone and so on means that it will be the best possible impression for people.</div> </div> </div> </div>The issue is that due to a lot of sketchy industry-practices in the past, <i>nobody </i>can be sure any sort of &quot;jankiness&quot; in Bloodlines 2 is gone. Somebody else brought up microtransactions a couple of posts before. You'd think that since this is purely a single-player-game we wouldn't have to talk about stuff like that... but the way things are in the videogames-industry these days, it's a legit question whether this game has microtransactions or not. Due to how things are in the videogames-scene these days, the switch to Chinese Room was news - while everything else was just worthless. To take a 2023-game: Compare previews for the game &quot;Redfall&quot; with how the game turned out to be. And then after a disastrous launch, you get an article like <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2023-06-01/arcane-s-redfall-misfire-for-xbox-panned-after-7-5-billion-microsoft-deal\" target=\"_blank\">this one</a> that illustrates how both publisher-pressure and developer-shortcomings led to a game-release that was just subpar. That's why genuine game-play before launch is so important: Both in terms of PR and in terms of what's good for the customer, you wanna get an honest picture of the actual game. And we didn't get that with the latest reveal/news-update of Bloodlines 2.<br /> <br /> My negative prediction of a couple dozen words is about as serious as the Jezebel-article you posted. Me and her are just speculation - but she gets paid by the word (or has a minimum-word-requirement), so naturally, she's a bit more verbose in her article than I was in my prediction. But it all amounts to the same thing: The PR-strategy for releasing information about this game sucks in my opinion. What people want is authenticity and passion. This round of news for Bloodlines 2 exhibited neither.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522324#post1522324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A lot of the complaints say, &quot;We should have gameplay!&quot;<br /> <br /> Vs.<br /> <br /> &quot;We should have had footage the entire way!&quot;<br /> <br /> Which seem contradictory.</div> </div> </div> </div>?<br /> <br /> I'm not sure what the argument is...? We got no genuine gameplay-video in this round of previews for Bloodlines 2. That's the issue. I don't think anybody asks for weekly updates of development for a game from day 1 but basic news like a switch to a new studio should be made public. And a year before release, a game-studio shouldn't tease game-play anymore but instead a portion of the game should be shown.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T13:48:56-07:00","id":1522356,"title":"","content":"I am personally a bit more hopeful than I was before the announcement. I prefer the elder start way more than the thinblood one.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T13:50:12-07:00","id":1522357,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522355#post1522355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What people want is authenticity and passion.</div> </div> </div> </div> I am sorry for be so crude with what I will say, but I find this phrase quite questionable and even disgusting. Because if you are 100% authentic it is easier for people to find a reason to hate you (expecially nowdays) or in this case what you are doing, the ideal is that we could be 100% authentic and show that everything is fine and that everything is progressing well, but If you live long enough you know that the &quot;ideal&quot; is rarely achieved and showing that you are having problems is inviting problems to your door.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27832-psicose","name":"Psicose","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27832_1.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-10T14:14:24-07:00","id":1522359,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Psicose</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522357#post1522357\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I am sorry for be so crude with what I will say, but I find this phrase quite questionable and even disgusting. Because if you are 100% authentic it is easier for people to find a reason to hate you (expecially nowdays) or in this case what you are doing, the ideal is that we could be 100% authentic and show that everything is fine and that everything is progressing well, but If you live long enough you know that the &quot;ideal&quot; is rarely achieved and showing that you are having problems is inviting problems to your door.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>The thing is gamer-audiences can understand that &quot;nobody's perfect&quot; is a thing while also appreciating that after all these scandals the videogames-industry has had, just showing gameplay of an in-development-build of the game is a good indication of investment and passion by the developers. Take Baldurs Gate 3: That game had been in early-acces for a while. But somehow that whole process of public beta-testing hasn't ruined the game in terms of sales and publicity. Or I mentioned Path Of Exile 2 before... When you see gameplay-videoes that preview that game it's people actually playing the game. Mistakes happen, a mechanic doesn't go off like it's supposed to... But it's a build of the game in development and the game is supposed to come out next year (and it's free-to-play). And what the previews are about is showing off new mechanics and how they've tried to improve the qualities of Path Of Exile 1. But what these previews convey is show people what the game's like and so that they know what they get when they play the game.<br /> <br /> There's a lot of hype for Path Of Exile 2 and people love Baldurs Gate 3... nothing of what has happened or is happening with these games in terms of PR is happening with Bloodlines 2. For a game that is supposed to come out in a year, their PR is very guarded and secretive (too much so, in my opinion).<br /> <br /> So this isn't about &quot;idealism vs reality&quot; and more about a contrast of &quot;effective PR vs ineffective PR&quot;. Your characterization misses the mark on that count.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T10:22:22-07:00","id":1522831,"title":"","content":"There's going to be a series of dev-diaries from people at Chinese Room apparently. The first one can be found <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2/news/welcome-to-the-chinese-room\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.<br /> <br /> It's mostly an introduction but I think the most important part was this:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> While making decisions about Bloodlines 2, one constant reference is our first game pillar: \u201cFeel like a Vampire\u201d. Everything you do in this game should make you feel like a predator of the night.<br /> <br /> In video games, we often get to be a mighty hero fighting against the darkness. Vampires, especially as playable characters, are underrepresented. We\u2019re building the game around the experience of doing things only a Kindred can. With non-combat gameplay, we found early on we were doing the RPG tropes: find a keycard to open a door, turn on a generator to restore power to a lift. We put in a rule that the non-combat gameplay should be about something only a vampire could do; keep it aspirational.<br /> <br /> When we were exploring combat, it started off playing like Dishonored (which we love), but that didn\u2019t feel right for a vampire: players were very cautious and afraid of the enemies they encountered. To us, a Kindred should stalk its prey and strike fearlessly like a predator. We want to build an action experience where players feel confident, almost trolling the enemies with their disciplines. Testers use the phrase \u201cplaying with your food,\u201d which we love and illustrates how we think a Vampire: The Masquerade ARPG should feel has come up in playthroughs.\u200b<br /> <br /> Most action games offer a power fantasy; I like to call ours a confidence fantasy. When you have a supernatural edge and immortality to back you up, there should be a sense of \u201cI know what is going on and, I can control this situation.\u201d We want to give you the tools to do that in combat, conversations, or travelling across the city. When they come together, you should be immersed in the feeling of being a Vampire.<br /> <br /> We have two more game pillars. \u201cVisceral, Immersive Combat\u201d and \u201cExploring the World of Darkness\u201d. We\u2019ll explore these in-depth later down the line.\u200b </div> </div> </div>First impression from me: too much talk about what the game is <i>not </i>like. I would've been fine with that a year ago as some sort of dev-direction while everybody was still knee-deep in development but now... &quot;Confidence-fantasy&quot; isn't a thing. If Dishonored is a bad comparison, what is a good comparison instead...?<br /> <br /> As I've mentioned before, my personal gut reaction to stuff like this is &quot;pessimism&quot;. Like, the whole explanation of how it's not-Dishonored and &quot;playing with your food&quot; is the phrase used by testers for the gameplay... I just immediately thought of my pessimistic prediction I made some time ago that this is what combat is gonna be like: &quot;Then the other 20% are combat-encounters where in a limited space you're gonna use your powers (and depending on what Clan you picked you have different ones) but in terms of gameplay it's mostly just a bunch of button-mashing and (depending on the Clan) various kinds of visual effects happen on the screen&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T10:49:41-07:00","id":1522835,"title":"","content":"Strike fearlessly &quot;like a predator&quot;, you say? I think that too many times, people who have this in mind are forgetting that a lot of &quot;prey&quot; ended up being way bigger than their predators. Some specificity would go a long way here; saying that targets are like mice to cats or antelope to big cats would clear up a lot of ambiguity clouding the intention.<br /> <br /> (Also, this is ignoring how Kindred could work this way but typically act as micropredators to avoid scrutiny that ends with learning if Fortitude can stop HEAT or HEDP rounds. Spoilers: no, it cannot.)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T16:29:39-07:00","id":1522862,"title":"","content":"I admit, it does sound exciting. Perhaps because it's been a while since I played an Elder chronicle.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522835#post1522835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Strike fearlessly &quot;like a predator&quot;, you say? I think that too many times, people who have this in mind are forgetting that a lot of &quot;prey&quot; ended up being way bigger than their predators. Some specificity would go a long way here; saying that targets are like mice to cats or antelope to big cats would clear up a lot of ambiguity clouding the intention.<br /> <br /> (Also, this is ignoring how Kindred could work this way but typically act as micropredators to avoid scrutiny that ends with learning if Fortitude can stop HEAT or HEDP rounds. Spoilers: no, it cannot.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, not to be the &quot;achtully&quot; guy but it can. It can even literally make you invulnerable at the highest levels, to the point that not even Mage BS can get through it.<br /> <br /> Of course there is a difference between an barely an Elder like Lacroix and a low gen Elder who has a Discipline list longer than a giraffe.<br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T18:59:24-07:00","id":1522871,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Technoma</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522862#post1522862\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I admit, it does sound exciting. Perhaps because it's been a while since I played an Elder chronicle.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> I mean, not to be the &quot;achtully&quot; guy but it can. It can even literally make you invulnerable at the highest levels, to the point that not even Mage BS can get through it.<br /> <br /> Of course there is a difference between an barely an Elder like Lacroix and a low gen Elder who has a Discipline list longer than a giraffe.<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>Antediluvian level Fortitude isn't Fortitude anymore, just like how 3rd gens aren't really vampires anymore (both are plot devices more than anything else). Vampires are not the monster type to go to for super-resilience; maybe nine extra dice and a neat trick or three gets left behind really quickly when people start firing shaped charges at you. Don't count on Adamantine to help you, either; the difficulty of the roll makes it a rather desperate situation to succeed vs someone with a potentially higher dice pool making an attack at a noticeably lower difficulty. Much like HIT Mark countermagick, the math does not work out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-20T22:11:16-07:00","id":1522878,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522871#post1522871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Antediluvian level Fortitude isn't Fortitude anymore, just like how 3rd gens aren't really vampires anymore (both are plot devices more than anything else). Vampires are not the monster type to go to for super-resilience; maybe nine extra dice and a neat trick or three gets left behind really quickly when people start firing shaped charges at you. Don't count on Adamantine to help you, either; the difficulty of the roll makes it a rather desperate situation to succeed vs someone with a potentially higher dice pool making an attack at a noticeably lower difficulty. Much like HIT Mark countermagick, the math does not work out.</div> </div> </div> </div>I was just thinking about Arm of Prometheus that made one limb completely invincible.<br /> I played in a chronicle where one of the enemies we faced that had a full set invulnerability through rotation of multiple 9 Dot powers. We had to predict the turn he was &quot;vulnerable&quot;, though he had other Disciplines and other Fortitude powers that still made him a slog to go through.<br /> <br /> Even without these extremely high disciplines, you could easily develop a set of powers that counters practically everything. Lasombra was infamous on this since their Elders can have 20+ Agg Soak even without creating custom combo disciplines/ or custom 5+ dot abilities. (Or worse Shadow Watchtower, where you are immune to everyrhing but sunlight. Straigh up one of the best, if not the best default high level discipline power)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T03:20:19-07:00","id":1522885,"title":"","content":"I'll be really upset if we don't get the club owning Tremere girl.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T06:17:44-07:00","id":1522889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522835#post1522835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Strike fearlessly &quot;like a predator&quot;, you say? I think that too many times, people who have this in mind are forgetting that a lot of &quot;prey&quot; ended up being way bigger than their predators. Some specificity would go a long way here; saying that targets are like mice to cats or antelope to big cats would clear up a lot of ambiguity clouding the intention.</div> </div> </div> </div>Really, even cats don't go after mice fearlessly, per se; nobody wants their face to get scratched up by a desperately struggling meal.<br /> <br /> Real life predators are extremely cautious, because needing to eat things that can move means they can hurt you even if you succeed (note: most hunts fail), and every injury makes it more difficult to succeed next time.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T07:08:25-07:00","id":1522890,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522835#post1522835\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Strike fearlessly &quot;like a predator&quot;, you say? I think that too many times, people who have this in mind are forgetting that a lot of &quot;prey&quot; ended up being way bigger than their predators. Some specificity would go a long way here; saying that targets are like mice to cats or antelope to big cats would clear up a lot of ambiguity clouding the intention.<br /> <br /> (Also, this is ignoring how Kindred could work this way but typically act as micropredators to avoid scrutiny that ends with learning if Fortitude can stop HEAT or HEDP rounds. Spoilers: no, it cannot.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I think it could fit, as the protagonist is supposed to be a several hundreds year old elder. I think being cautious and afraid of dealing with mortals would undermine that idea quite a bit. Ideally there will be plenty of things that can threaten you, but I think what they're discussing as general gameplay should work pretty well. Regardless I wouldn't take this game as an example of how the average vampire (especially young neonates) would act.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T11:59:59-07:00","id":1522914,"title":"","content":"While I very much appreciate the discussion of predators, I think it's kind of a shame that dev blog opted for the &quot;sexier&quot; term of predator over the much truer term of parasite. Parasite probably isn't as good of a word for selling an action RPG; but why not take a chance to distinguish yourself (also playable vampires aren't as uncommon as they seem to think)? Parasite is also a great word to pair with the concept of a &quot;confidence fantasy&quot; to contrast to a power fantasy. Elder vampires might be more tarantula hawk than liver fluke, but parasites are so successful because they don't just pounce and kill to survive. The manipulate, they deceive, they lure and bait, they want their target in just the right circumstance and conditions for their needs. And that takes some confidence to pull off; while also sounding a lot like what a vampire does.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T13:55:31-07:00","id":1522921,"title":"","content":"Perhaps they should have referred to vampires as sandwich connoisseurs instead of predators.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Technoma</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522878#post1522878\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I was just thinking about Arm of Prometheus that made one limb completely invincible.</div> </div> </div> </div>Great, so there's one limb left behind after everything else gets blown to bits.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I played in a chronicle where one of the enemies we faced that had a full set invulnerability through rotation of multiple 9 Dot powers. We had to predict the turn he was &quot;vulnerable&quot;, though he had other Disciplines and other Fortitude powers that still made him a slog to go through. </div> </div> </div>Doesn't each power take away from the dice that you get to roll normally?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> Even without these extremely high disciplines, you could easily develop a set of powers that counters practically everything. Lasombra was infamous on this since their Elders can have 20+ Agg Soak even without creating custom combo disciplines/ or custom 5+ dot abilities. (Or worse Shadow Watchtower, where you are immune to everyrhing but sunlight. Straigh up one of the best, if not the best default high level discipline power) </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=BYqZet63wYQ\" data-code=\"BYqZet63wYQ\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/BYqZet63wYQ/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> Kill it with Sun Enfleshed.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-21T22:08:13-07:00","id":1522936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1521899-bloodlines-2-announcement-trailers-yes-it-lives-and-yes-it-s-still-in-seattle?p=1522921#post1522921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Doesn't each power take away from the dice that you get to roll normally?<br /></div> </div> </div> </div>No? You can as many additional Discipline powers past 5 Dot as long as you have the XP to spend on it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27335-technoma","name":"Technoma","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"103"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-22T07:25:25-07:00","id":1522957,"title":"","content":"What I see looks good to me. But I'll wait and see how things develop and more information is released before I make my decision if I look forward to this game or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-09-29T00:13:28-07:00","id":1523297,"title":"","content":"I admit, I may not even get this now.<br /> <br /> I was looking forward to being a Neonate learning about Seattle but an Elder doesn't interest me.<br /> <br /> I'm Anarchs and rebellion.<br /> <br /> Plus. it doesn't seem like they're keeping any of the characters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},